          "lastBuildDate": "2024-04-06T11:48:51.000Z",
          "description": "Embark on a magical journey with \"Mythology for Kids\"! Join us as we delve into the captivating world of ancient myths and legends from around the globe, specially crafted for curious young minds (and grownups too!). Each episode brings to life fascinating stories of gods,goddesses,heroes and creatures,weaving together adventure,imagination and valuable life lessons. Tune in to ignite your imagination, spark your curiosity, and explore the wonders of stories that shape our world. \n\n*Myths are adapted from original sources to be child-appropriate. We recommend checking content before sharing*",
